# Code style

- Prefer small, readable files over clever abstractions.
- Use clear names; avoid abbreviations unless common (`id`, `url`).
- Keep comments rare — only explain non-obvious intent.
- Match existing formatting in the file you edit.
- Do not add dependencies unless the user asks.
